### 關聯範例：品牌（多對一，以 code 關聯）、標籤（多對多，以 id 關聯）
### 先依 auth.http 的說明登入並設定 session、xsrf；由上往下執行；新增取得的代碼、id 會存成變數，後面的請求直接使用，可重複執行

### 1. 新增兩個品牌（代碼不可重複，用時間戳記產生）
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/brand
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "APPLE_{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "Apple"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("brandId", response.body.data.id);
    client.global.set("brandCode", response.body.data.code);
%}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/brand
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SAMSUNG_{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "Samsung"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("brandId2", response.body.data.id);
    client.global.set("brandCode2", response.body.data.code);
%}

### 2. 新增兩個標籤
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tag
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "新品"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tagId1", response.body.data.id);
%}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tag
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "熱銷"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tagId2", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. 新增商品：送 brandCode、tagIds；回傳會帶出完整的 brand 物件
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "IP-{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "iPhone",
  "category": "ELECTRONICS",
  "price": 29900,
  "stock": 5,
  "onSale": true,
  "brandCode": "{{brandCode}}",
  "tagIds": [{{tagId1}}, {{tagId2}}]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("productId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 品牌不存在 → 400
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "XX-{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "不存在的品牌",
  "category": "OTHER",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 1,
  "onSale": true,
  "brandCode": "NOT_EXISTS"
}

### 標籤不存在 → 400，訊息列出不存在的 id
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "XX-{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "不存在的標籤",
  "category": "OTHER",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 1,
  "onSale": true,
  "tagIds": [{{tagId1}}, 999999]
}

### 4. 依品牌、標籤查詢商品；每筆商品都帶出 brand
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product/queryPage
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandCode": "{{brandCode}}",
  "tagId": {{tagId1}}
}

### 5. 標籤只回 id，前端用 ids 換成名稱
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tag/query
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [{{tagId1}}, {{tagId2}}]
}

### 品牌下拉選單：依關鍵字查詢
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/brand/query
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "Apple"
}

### 6. 換品牌：以 brandCode 為準，送來的 brand 物件會被忽略；回傳的 brand 變成 Samsung
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/product/{{productId}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandCode": "{{brandCode2}}",
  "brand": { "code": "IGNORED", "name": "會被忽略" }
}

### 7. 換標籤：整批取代為只剩「熱銷」；給 [] 為清空，不給則不改
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/product/{{productId}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tagIds": [{{tagId2}}]
}

### 8. 品牌可改名稱
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/brand/{{brandId2}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Samsung Electronics"
}

### 品牌代碼建立後不可修改 → 400
# @no-cookie-jar
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/brand/{{brandId2}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "OTHER"
}

### 9. 仍有商品使用時不可刪除 → 409
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/brand/{{brandId2}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tag/{{tagId2}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### 10. 沒有商品使用的可以刪除：第一個品牌（已換掉）、「新品」標籤（已移除）
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/brand/{{brandId}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tag/{{tagId1}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### 11. 刪除商品後，品牌、標籤就能刪除
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/product/{{productId}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/brand/{{brandId2}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

###
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tag/{{tagId2}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
